  "description": "Sicklines.com, April 26, 2007 - \"It is possibly one of the best deals you?ll ever come across on a new bike and the parts alone are worth the price of the complete bike. Teamed with the FreeDrive system, the EC-D brings a great bike to the public at a stellar price\" Mountain Bike, April 2007 - \"Getting into downhill racing and riding can be an expensive hobby, so it?s nice to see Mongoose making it more affordable by offering a rig with a great parts spec and excellent ride characteristics for $3000.\" Mountain Bike Action, March 2007 - \"Eric Carter is more than deserving of a signature bike. The complete bike features a RockShox Boxxer Team fork and a Fox DHX 5.0 shock. The 8.4-inch travel EC-D uses Mongoose's Freedrive suspension system to reduce bob and pedal efficiently. The EC-D is a total steal for downhill racers and is equipped with a SRAM X.9 drivetrain and Avid Juicy 7 disc brakes.\" Australian Mountain Bike, Feb/Mar 07 - \"Fast out of the corners and stable over the big hits, the EC-D suits aggressive riding. Solid spec ensures seasons of reliable performance.\"",
